{"id":"n25016-1-11","stage":5,"title":"인근 · 邻近","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25016-1-11-1","ko":"새로 이사 간 동네는 살기 좋아요?","zh":"新搬到的社区住起来舒服吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"새로","meaning":"新","explanation":"새로：新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"1","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이사","meaning":"搬家","explanation":"이사：搬家","readings":[{"term":"이사","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71138","senseId":"1","lemma":"이사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"간","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동네는","meaning":"小区，社区，村庄","explanation":"동네：小区，社区，村庄；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"동네","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62417","senseId":"2","lemma":"동네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살기","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아요?","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"从前没有而首次。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"925efb171a8616cc","term":"이사","zh":"搬家","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3","entryId":"71138","definition":"离开原先生活的地方，搬去别的地方。","pronunciation":["이사"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"f97ccdfe641c2837","term":"동네","zh":"小区，社区，村庄","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3","entryId":"62417","definition":"多户人家聚集在一起生活的地方。","pronunciation":["동ː네"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/ec5e68d0980d9a7ffe92.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25016-1-11-2","ko":"네. 집 인근에 병원, 백화점, 극장이 있어서 살기 편해요.","zh":"是的。房子附近有医院、百货公司和电影院，生活很方便。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집","meaning":"房子，窝，巢","explanation":"집：房子，窝，巢","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"1","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인근에","meaning":"邻近，附近","explanation":"인근：邻近，附近；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"인근","audio":"/audio/b68626d37c7c1b111087.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25016","senseId":"1","lemma":"인근","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"병원,","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"백화점,","meaning":"百货商店","explanation":"백화점：百货商店","readings":[{"term":"백화점","audio":"/audio/655eab9f02534cf0ba14.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26844","senseId":"1","lemma":"백화점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"극장이","meaning":"剧场，戏院","explanation":"극장：剧场，戏院；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"극장","audio":"/audio/2da495228ef48b2e8892.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31667","senseId":"1","lemma":"극장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어서","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살기","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"편해요.","meaning":"方便","explanation":"편하다：方便；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"편하다","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71334","senseId":"2","lemma":"편하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"房子，窝，巢","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"人或动物为了遮寒挡暑等，进里面生活而盖的建筑物。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"b68626d37c7c1b11","term":"인근","zh":"邻近，附近","audio":"/audio/b68626d37c7c1b111087.mp3","entryId":"25016","definition":"近的地方。","pronunciation":["인근"]},{"id":"4f4c2d79c47ca512","term":"병원","zh":"医院","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3","entryId":"62271","definition":"具备相关设施、由医生和护士治疗病人的地方。","pronunciation":["병ː원"]},{"id":"655eab9f02534cf0","term":"백화점","zh":"百货商店","audio":"/audio/655eab9f02534cf0ba14.mp3","entryId":"26844","definition":"在一个建筑内按照种类分区摆放和销售各种商品的大商店。","pronunciation":["배콰점"]},{"id":"2da495228ef48b2e","term":"극장","zh":"剧场，戏院","audio":"/audio/2da495228ef48b2e8892.mp3","entryId":"31667","definition":"具有进行话剧、音乐、舞蹈等表演或放映电影的设施的地方。","pronunciation":["극짱"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"33bf1e37d2739b22","term":"편하다","zh":"方便","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3","entryId":"71334","definition":"容易而简便。","pronunciation":["편하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a8869f18d6d4a314a5ba.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.177,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25016","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":152,"sequenceScore":3.0037,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的。房子附近有医院、百货公司和电影院，生活很方便。","裕敏的妈妈，我们没见面的这段时间里似乎变得更年轻了。","新搬到的社区住起来舒服吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是的。房子附近有医院、百货公司和电影院，生活很方便。","新搬到的社区住起来舒服吗？","裕敏的妈妈，我们没见面的这段时间里似乎变得更年轻了。"],"answer":0}]}
